; Personal RPZ allowlist — loaded BEFORE hagezi.rpz, so passthru here wins
; over the blocklist. To un-block a domain: copy the pattern below (bare name
; + wildcard), BUMP THE SOA SERIAL (first number on the SOA line), then run:
;   sudo unbound-control auth_zone_reload hagezi.allow
$TTL 60
@ IN SOA localhost. root.localhost. 1 3600 1200 604800 60
  IN NS  localhost.

; placeholder entries — the domain doesn't exist, so these are inert; replace
; with real exceptions as needed
example-i-need.com  CNAME rpz-passthru.
*.example-i-need.com CNAME rpz-passthru.
